WEBVTT

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:56.320
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, it was Namek against Machine

00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:00.000
as Piccolo spearheaded the battle against the androids.

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:05.590
After reuniting with Kami and becoming a Super Namek,

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:10.550
the mighty Piccolo was the only one on Earth with enough strength to challenge the androids.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.010
As Piccolo fought, Goku waited for Vegeta and Trunks to finish their task in the Pendulum Room,

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.860
so that he could take his turn.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.130
Son, I know how you feel.

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:30.000
Their mission: to go beyond the level of Super Saiyan and achieve a new and higher level of power.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:35.410
Meanwhile, Bulma wasn't wasting any time.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:37.910
Using her extensive knowledge of electronics,

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:41.790
she invented a remote control that could cripple the Android circuitry

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.410
and render them helpless.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.780
That's great! Now we can destroy them!

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:53.640
Back at the battlefield, Piccolo was proving himself to be an equal match for Android 17.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:03:00.000
But his bid for victory was cut short when a much more formidable adversary arrived.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:07.570
Cell, the android nemesis that was cloned from the cells of the greatest fighters in the galaxy.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:17.220
His purpose, to integrate androids 17 and 18 into his body and become the most powerful creature in the entire universe.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:36.600
Thank you for bringing Seventeen and Eighteen here. It pleases me greatly.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:45.820
I thought I'd have more time than this.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:51.530
Man, now what? If he merges with those two, it's all over.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:59.800
That thing.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:07.040
He doesn't know. They don't even know who Zell is.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:21.120
I've been aching to behold this for so long, it's almost as if I've seen them before. I recognize them somehow.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:28.160
Droid 17, amazingly efficient. And 18, poetry in motion.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.670
Hmph. Wow.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:38.750
this one. He bears the red ribbon insignia. He must be one of Giraud's early or less efficient

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:48.530
models. Sniff the bouquet and now it is time to drink.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:18.950
We'll be right back.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.760
There must be thousands of them.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.520
Well now, let's get started, shall we?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:53.120
Shamed, it's hard, I know.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.800
Feel my power, and it's hard to bear.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.000
Ha ha ha.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:08.670
what do you mean it's not your power you stole it by taking the lives of innocent people

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:18.040
what bull stole it they're part of greatness now i've given them all a purpose you're nuts

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:29.990
what a horrible energy cell must have powered up

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:36.350
must be flipping out I'm flipping out oh dear I think I overdid it on the coffee guys I didn't

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:42.760
have any and I'm still about to jump out of my skin man this just isn't natural it's driving me

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:49.060
nuts hanging out here in the bleachers while the fight's going on yeah you said it this is nuts

00:07:49.060 --> 00:08:00.000
there must be something we can do I appreciate that you're both eager to help guys but I think our best bet is staying put until

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.940
until Bulma gets over here with her new remote control.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.230
Right.

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:09.910
Can't you guys fly faster than Bulma can get here in her jet?

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:12.870
One of you guys could save time by flying out to meet Bulma

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:14.210
and bringing the remote back.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.560
You're right.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:17.440
Of course I'm right.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:20.280
You can solve problems without your fists, you know.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:22.400
You should write that one down, Chi-Chi.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.040
Now, if you'll excuse me, Einstein,

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:29.210
I'm going to go meet Bulma.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:30.000
Good luck.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:34.490
I can't take this anymore!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.210
- Huh?

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.950
- I'm not sure if I can help or not,

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.490
but I'll never find out here.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:52.390
- Darn it, doesn't anyone listen?

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.810
Their heads are too thick.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:56.400
Oh, poopy.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.040
What am I talking about?

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.090
My goodness.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:04.930
If I was in his shoes, I would have probably done the same thing.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:10.650
My gosh, it seems like yesterday when I was just like them.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:14.120
I was considered the strongest in the world back then.

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:17.510
Now I'd do anything just to be able to help out again.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:26.270
Goku, please, we all need you.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:50.760
- Come on, what the heck is going on in there?

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.080
- Who's in the middle of something?

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.070
You're intruding.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.910
- Yes, I see that now.

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:00.000
How rude of me, there must be some way

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.180
I can make it up to you.

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.860
- No need for long-winded apologies.

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:06.510
Just go away.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:10.030
We have some business that we're trying to settle.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:15.290
- Ah, yes, yes, I see your point,

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.190
but I have a little business of my own

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:20.700
that I need to take care of.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:24.600
- 17, he came here to kill you and Android 18.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.520
Watch it, look out!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.740
- Huh?

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.620
Thank you, Piccolo. That was close.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:04.530
So what's the deal?

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:07.130
You said this creature's here to kill us?

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:09.560
His name is Cell.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.740
He was spawned by Dr. Giroux's

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.700
computer, and he came here to absorb

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.810
the two of you. If he

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.830
succeeds, and he's able to integrate

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.990
you and Android 18 into his being,

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.830
his evolution will be complete.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:22.930
What a creep.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:26.220
Rejoice, my brother and sister.

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:28.030
The three of us are like

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.000
pieces to a puzzle designed

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:34.080
and destined to fit together and form one whole.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.380
Unite with me and fulfill Dr. Giraud's dream

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.890
to create the ultimate warrior.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.130
It's a nice offer, but no thanks.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.140
Besides, it seems a little crowded in there already.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.790
I don't need you.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.430
This is what I am.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:52.070
It doesn't matter what you think you are.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:56.260
You are part of me, and I am going to absorb you.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:59.440
Go ahead and give it your best shot, Cell.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:06.190
17! I would not fight him. It is extremely risky.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:10.910
It would be best for the both of you to run.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.950
This is a creature that has great power.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:18.360
Escape is highly recommended.

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:20.310
Now you speak.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:23.250
Well, go ahead and take off if you want.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.720
Don't you worry.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:30.000
I'll take care of the big bad monster.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.330
Ready?

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:34.850
You shouldn't have interfered, Bigelow.

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:56.210
That one really smarts.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:03.940
Come on, it doesn't seem like Seventeen and Piccolo are even trying.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:08.740
They are. The creature has a much bigger power than them, though.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:19.460
You should leave here while you can.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.240
Huh?

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:25.420
If the creature absorbs Seventeen, we will not be able to stop him.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:29.000
He will be too strong. You should go.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:44.350
- What would you do, stay or go?

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:45.620
- That's it.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.340
Come on, Piccolo, you can do this.

00:14:57.030 --> 00:14:59.830
Jenny now, Jenny as she goes.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:08.420
This one's for Gohan and Goku!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:54.350
wow i think piccolo did it what a bizarre creature that was brilliant what an attack

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:59.480
don't be fooled it's not over he's not dead

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:07.640
- What's the matter, Piccolo? What is it?

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:10.880
- Tim! Cell!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.000
