00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:27.520
You can't stop me, Bigelow, it's useless to resist.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:30.000
I am amused by your little one-man arm.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:37.490
But I have run out of patience the road of life ends here for you. You've reached a dead end

