00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:42.530
this up much longer alone at last it seems that piccolo will no longer be joining us

00:21:53.970 --> 00:22:00.000
don't be afraid android 17 this is your destiny it has always been

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:03.740
You are a part of me.

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:07.900
Me too, my little peach.

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:09.900
I'm going to gobble you up.

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:16.880
With Cell in their midst,

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:18.880
the androids now have much more

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:20.880
