00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:26.770
Is the combined strength of the androids

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:28.770
enough to prevent Cell from absorbing them

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:30.000
into his being?

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.220
Stay tuned for scenes from the next episode of Dragon Ball Z.
